  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Union Bas-Kalia Palm Oil Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Palm oil.Beneficiaries: 450 (300 women).Description: The project will support 25 palm oil producer groups to increase the quantity and quality of palm oil and nuts produced and marketed from existing oil palms, as well as increase their long term production capacity through a nursery and expanded plantations.</narrative>
  </description>
